Subject: Preserve AX native packed stores and retail u16 word fields
Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Keep all original AX voice-format decisions, synchronization flags,
depop arithmetic and studio call/update order. Native packed records
cannot provide aligned u32/s32 output pointers. Use byte cursors and
memcpy-backed native metadata access, retaining the retail high/low
u16 meanings of the PCM gain/predictor word. Console code and packed
record footprints remain intact. This does not export DSP wire data,
provide a DSP engine or satisfy original AX/THP audio initialization.

